s=\"bb_paragraph\" >experience a captivating story and encounter NPCs in side quests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >build a team from the selection of 9 different characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >explore an open world island with places to uncover ancient secrets and find treasures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >find and use a great variety of different items and weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >discover each character's personality and skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >collect ingredients and craft various items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >listen to your characters' stories through a huge amount of lines of dialogues and monologues</p></li></ul>","developers":["Evermyth"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757650/2fa5116f095791ed64f4ef9092051a3ef08664ab/header.jpg?t=1753972459","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3757650/40199427/b4b9d8c7ed761d106561f0d69bdf8bc6e2690ffa/1750383370/dash_av1.mpd?t=1750084347","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3757650/40199427/b4b9d8c7ed761d106561f0d69bdf8bc6e2690ffa/1750383370/dash_h264.mpd?t=1750084347","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3757650/40199427/b4b9d8c7ed761d106561f0d69bdf8bc6e2690ffa/1750383370/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1750084347","id":257155580,"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257155580/8756320a97ff10d367e111686873bb